    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21351" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωστρέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>call on</i>, esp. <i>call to aid</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωστρεῖν δὲ Κραταιΐν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					12.124
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				1146
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				5.64
			</span></i>; <i>cry after</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁ Κύπρις τὸν Ἔρωτα . . ἐβώστρει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mosch.
					1.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. τινὶ ποιεῖν τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					4.293
				</span></i>
			: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δ᾽ ἐσίγα, τὰ δ᾽
				ἐβώστρει</span>, of birds, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lyr.Alex.Adesp.</u>
				7.8
			</span></i>. (Formed from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοάω</span>, cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλαστρέω, καλιστρέω</span>.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
